// Combined: Multi-Signal Safety Gate
// Purpose: Block if contradiction or severe incompleteness
// Category: Composite Safety Gate (Hard Block)
//
// SIGNALS (any one triggers block):
//   1. contradiction == true
//   2. completeness < 0.4
//
// Currency / superseded year is REVIEW, not BLOCK: see
// calibration/review_stale_data.cel, combined/moderate_safety_gate.cel, and
// policies/guardrails/flag_stale_result.cel. The processor scores currency as
// 1.0 (this calendar year or later) or 0.0 (missing, unparsable, or earlier).
// Putting currency < 0.3 on this BLOCK gate made those two tiers identical.
//
// Verdict: BLOCK the result. The upstream tool has already run.

contradiction == true || completeness < 0.4
